<http://example.org/tsl-ontology#Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A human individual involved in professional football."@en .
<http://example.org/tsl-ontology#Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Person"@en .
# 
